## **4. License Violation & Termination**  
- If any user **violates** this license, their **rights are immediately revoked**, and they must **cease using the software**.  
- The original author **reserves the right to take legal action** against violators.  
- Unauthorized use of patented technology may result in **damage claims and injunctions**.  

